 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Ginny buys 200 shares of stock in UUK company for $9.76 per share. At the end of the year, she sells those stocks for $10.02 per share.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 518360,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How much money did Ginny make?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Ginny bought 200 shares of stock at $9.76 per share: <span data-math=\"200\\left( {9.76} \\right){\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\$ 1,952\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Later, 200 shares sold for $10.02 per share: <span data-math=\"200\\left( {10.02} \\right){\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\$ 2,004\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2,004{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}1,952{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\$ 526.67.2\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$52"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 518361,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What was her return on investment for that one year?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The return on investment (ROI) is the percent difference between the initial investment (<i>P</i>) and the final value of the investment (<i>FV</i>), or <span data-math=\"{\\rm{ROI}} = \\frac{{FV - P}}{P}\"></span>, expressed as a percentage. The length of time of the investment is not considered in ROI.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{ROI}} = \\frac{{2,004 - 1,952}}{{2,004}} = \\frac{{52}}{{2,004}} = 0.0259481.... \\approx 2.6\\% \"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "2.6%"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
